{"resourceIdentifier":"596","resourceName":"TIST Program in Kenya, VCS 003","description":"Since its inception in 1999, over 63,000 participants organized into over 8,900 TIST Small Groups have planted over ten million trees in Tanzania, India, Kenya, Uganda, Nicaragua, and Honduras - accomplishing GhG sequestration through tree planting, creating a potential long-term income stream, and developing sustainable environments and livelihoods. Currently, over 50,000 TIST participants in over 6,900 Small Groups are registered in the TIST program in Kenya and are working to break their local cycle of deforestation, drought, and famine.  The trees planted in tens of thousands of discrete groves and land parcels are already beginning to reduce erosion, stabilize and enrich the soil, and will soon be providing shade.   This PD is a subset of the reforestation project in Kenya and applies to 350 of the Small Groups, 2,632 members, 1,483 project areas and 421.5 ha.","location":{"latitude":0.012579,"longitude":37.648572},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2020-09-29","endExclusive":"2020-10-30","endInclusive":"2020-10-29"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"596"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Central Rift Valley"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Clean Air Action Corporation"},{"type":"string","value":"ME, United States"},{"type":"string","value":"918-747-8770"},{"type":"string","value":"https://program.tist.org/"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Late to verify"},{"type":"assetSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"596"},{"type":"bufferSearchLink","value":null,"targetId":"596"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"14482"}]},{"code":"TOTAL_BUFFER_POOL_CREDITS","values":[{"type":"integer","value":10206}]},{"code":"PRI